</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\">\\(\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" href=\"?note=9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" title=\"20-thm-sacks-splitting\">20-thm-sacks-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f2d2355efa286b3\" href=\"?note=4f2d2355efa286b3\" title=\"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join\">20-prop-disjoint-ce-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ambos\\text{-}split}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\land\n\\mathbf a_0\\not\\le\\mathbf a_1\\land\\mathbf a_1\\not\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\n\\mathbf b=\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ambos\\text{-}split}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\land\n\\mathbf a_0\\not\\le\\mathbf a_1\\land\\mathbf a_1\\not\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\n\\mathbf b=\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取集合形式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=B\">\\(C=B\\)</span>，则两边都严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。若两边可比较，其 join 等于较大的一边，矛盾。原稿的 Ambos 名称无此书来源；保留标识，按实际 Sacks 推论更名。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 7.5.3；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id"